  </header>

  <section class="service-block" id="fitting" style="padding-top:0">
    <h2 class="h3">Fitting and test rides</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The configurator suggests a size from your height. If you are between sizes or want a fitting before you order, write to us and we arrange it.</p>
      <a class="linkline mt-4" href="mailto:info@sendabikes.com?subject=Fitting">Ask for a fitting</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="faq">
    <h2 class="h3">Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>When will the first bikes be delivered?</summary><p>SENDA Vent and ORMA Momentum are delivered from March 2027. We write if anything moves.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What can I order now?</summary><p>The SENDA Vent road bike, configured to your size and parts, and the ORMA Momentum wheelset. SENDA Gravel follows; join the list to hear first.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How does ordering work?</summary><p>Your order is binding. For SENDA Vent you pay a 20% deposit by invoice and the balance before delivery; ORMA Momentum is invoiced in full. If SENDA cannot deliver, or delivers substantially later than planned, you get your payment back. See the <a href="/terms/">order terms</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do ORMA wheels fit my bike?</summary><p>Momentum is made for disc brakes and 12 mm thru-axles. The compatibility table on the wheelset page covers the details.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you deliver outside Switzerland?</summary><p>For now we deliver within Switzerland only. Shipping costs CHF 50.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block" id="contact">
    <h2 class="h3">Contact</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:info@sendabikes.com">info@sendabikes.com</a>. We answer within one working day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

